(2, 'About Us', 'about-us', '<div>Snappi is an all-in-one online business management platform designed for Nigerian businesses. It helps businesses manage sales, orders, payments, POS operations, QR code ordering, staff access, billing, and performance reports from one easy-to-use dashboard. Snappi supports restaurants, supermarkets, pharmacies, retail stores, and other businesses looking to operate smarter and faster online</div>', 1, 'header', 0, '2025-10-20 02:15:50', '2026-01-23 22:08:39');
